    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 32 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52), as amended, I, Mangala Samaraweera,Minister of Finance and Mass Media, do by this Order amend the Excise Notification No. 03/2018, published in the ExtraordinaryGazette No. 2054/41 dated January 18, 2018 in order to revise the opening and closing hours of Toddy Taverns, specified in theItem No. 02 of Schedule of that Notification by substituting the opening and closing hours specified in the Schedule belowwith effect from June 13, 2018.",
